{"4550120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Sphere", "steam_appid": 4550120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight!</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shoot, parry, dodge and destroy your way to victory! Collect powerful upgrades as you fight through the waves, to reach the final boss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.mp4?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize!</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft and trade your way to a powerful build! Stack multiple of the same card to make the effect more powerful. You can aim for a purely parry based build, a dodge based build, a damage over time based build... there are TONS of fun combinations and possibilities!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.mp4?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive!</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The cubes are relentless. Overpower them before they overpower you! Complete specific goals to unlock new weapon abilities, new parry abilities, new skins, new cards and more for your next run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d9.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d9.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d9.mp4?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight!</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Shoot, parry, dodge and destroy your way to victory! Collect powerful upgrades as you fight through the waves, to reach the final boss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/6b3b14ce0648d35db5c155cf3b9bc450.mp4?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize!</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft and trade your way to a powerful build! Stack multiple of the same card to make the effect more powerful. You can aim for a purely parry based build, a dodge based build, a damage over time based build... there are TONS of fun combinations and possibilities!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/7fed19e9fb8f563308f98534d1330885.mp4?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive!</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The cubes are relentless. Overpower them before they overpower you! Complete specific goals to unlock new weapon abilities, new parry abilities, new skins, new cards and more for your next run!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d9.poster.avif?t=1780048826\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d9.webm?t=1780048826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4550120/extras/02075cf1cfdd878bc080eec60ac764d